  "label": "Terrorism Associations with Muslims",
  "description": "A widely recognized and harmful stereotype that equates Muslims or people from the Middle East with terrorism, often used to justify prejudice, discrimination, or violence against these groups. This stereotype is rooted in real-world events involving extremist groups, but it is applied broadly and inaccurately to all Muslims or Middle Easterners.",
